### Get all states
GET http://localhost:3000/states/


### Get state by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/states/8/


### Add a new district
POST http://localhost:3000/districts/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "districtName": "Bagalkot",
  "stateId": 3,
  "cases": 2323,
  "cured": 2000,
  "active": 315,
  "deaths": 8
}


### Get district by ID
GET http://localhost:3000/districts/322/


### Delete district by ID
DELETE http://localhost:3000/districts/322/


### Update a district
PUT http://localhost:3000/districts/322/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "districtName": "Nadia",
  "stateId": 3,
  "cases": 9628,
  "cured": 6524,
  "active": 3000,
  "deaths": 104
}


### Get state COVID stats
GET http://localhost:3000/states/3/stats/


### Get state name for a district
GET http://localhost:3000/districts/322/details/
